9	faq.md	MealBridge basics and frequently asked questions: MealBridge is a food donation and redistribution platform that connects donors, NGOs and volunteers. It has four roles: DONOR, NGO, VOLUNTEER and ADMIN. The role is chosen on the first screen, and an account can only sign in with the role it registered with.\n\nA one time password (OTP) is used only during registration to verify a new account. OTP is not a pickup or delivery step. Volunteers and NGOs do not need a code to pick up or receive food.	[-0.017470626,-0.024646154,0.06885352,-0.041219078,-0.053393904,0.015029751,0.016422307,-0.05356249,0.05986382,-0.09493411,0.004734137,-0.04436796,0.029512212,0.0016921805,0.00066302245,-0.033222124,0.10503852,-0.050613,0.028021313,-0.02139404,-0.0862818,-0.050624732,0.014089106,-0.0028234348,0.032426637,-0.05573582,0.012509492,0.0038529676,-0.028658502,0.0047085797,0.031624965,0.013606165,-0.01372723,-0.038694933,-0.018131094,0.084380955,0.11262611,-0.00830214,-0.09889504,-0.03918516,-0.022080656,-0.08041539,0.004977398,-0.06635176,0.08657262,0.034520585,-0.05244446,0.011821292,-0.061226733,-0.01110571,0.10996527,-0.04548809,0.0995308,0.025819056,-0.062752396,0.053410143,0.05331191,0.00044523523,-0.0882885,0.04209282,-0.0032339927,-0.0069700065,-0.0019813273,0.026984114,0.10782833,0.012142938,-0.009244372,0.08840714,-0.00033070444,-0.12613894,-0.01784481,-0.10750326,0.04783665,0.04084709,0.06909261,-0.046001203,-0.012543554,-0.01629746,0.08139826,0.009942945,-0.07348636,0.07265891,-0.0076188995,0.04968899,-0.036304537,0.0048188083,-0.031478472,0.027787095,-0.026661448,-0.047307566,-0.047499683,0.002880295,-0.006312125,-0.022666957,-0.031562585,0.025875174,-0.075821206,-0.032551184,-0.038852036,0.041401837,-0.053440537,0.058358233,0.055765525,-0.021285567,0.02738081,-0.052615296,-0.043751337,0.023257028,0.11256043,0.0062173135,0.013545821,0.018818926,0.061307214,0.047676522,-0.04578109,-0.00026174565,-0.10136107,-0.043145057,0.036168594,0.013192767,-0.017323736,0.05