10	faq.md	MealBridge basics and frequently asked questions: Every user gets notifications for important events, such as new matches, assignments and delivery updates. Open the Notifications page to read them. The Smart Search box understands meaning, so searching for "biryani" or "fruits" also finds related food and NGOs, not only exact words. The assignment chat lets the donor, the NGO and the volunteer of one assignment talk to each other.\n\nMealBridge is a community platform. Users should provide truthful food, location, expiry and contact information. The platform should not be used to promise medical, legal or emergency services.	[0.017994866,-0.027090522,0.044836883,0.0019070902,-0.054374255,0.022513937,0.055597845,-0.040374957,0.028315935,-0.09083992,-0.029165523,-0.053025614,0.007976993,-0.00643921,0.0050950595,-0.049681645,0.10323684,-0.05979029,-0.016637817,-0.04062449,-0.030220311,0.029734632,0.029133083,0.043510403,-0.014375511,-0.047149748,-0.019194368,-0.04005351,-0.025496231,0.032805525,0.026373198,0.03648228,0.09349444,0.010467324,-0.03512803,0.03392817,0.041497733,0.0011969593,-0.083252996,-0.072700486,-0.046458106,-0.13865484,0.002914339,-0.083133504,0.0946755,0.01162037,-0.10963956,-0.010287262,-0.0026187864,0.025491448,-0.038546756,-0.11511941,0.08069208,0.032092493,-0.005563444,0.06239657,0.01753129,0.02481766,-0.050494876,0.04494195,0.009066913,-0.03982254,0.023912618,0.0009811206,0.07005666,-0.03851792,-0.030505054,0.11763347,0.04045959,-0.1356083,0.025548398,-0.020644816,0.0688031,0.04351838,0.04546259,-0.008317566,0.0039386926,-0.031402633,0.010031782,0.06340397,-0.14418484,0.010623729,0.014836438,0.021692548,-0.0070874137,-0.009960006,-0.012540468,0.006489235,-0.011590034,-0.03163429,0.0089766495,0.0016471283,0.006940851,-0.022158595,-0.041067053,-0.0025502483,-0.05815622,-0.10005787,-0.027269945,0.035307996,-0.032417413,0.03190613,-0.0035619184,-0.015998276,0.013832285,0.013411319,-0.048991166,0.032770365,0.110328846,-0.005876154,-0.02956