11	food-matching.md	How food is matched with NGOs: An admin creates a match between a POSTED donation and a verified NGO. Each match gets a score from several practical signals: the distance between the donation and the NGO, whether the quantity fits the NGO capacity, how urgent the expiry time is, the remaining capacity of the NGO, how well the food fits the NGO's food requirements, and the semantic similarity between the food and the NGO profile calculated from embeddings.\n\nA new match starts as PENDING. The NGO can accept or reject a PENDING match. Only an ACCEPTED match can be turned into a delivery assignment. If an NGO rejects a match, the donation can be offered to another NGO.	[-0.050256588,0.013569612,-0.028169593,0.040609196,0.022488352,0.026081784,0.022774,-0.042496607,0.0750262,-0.0026456434,0.057810098,-0.08440657,-0.012780342,0.047338344,0.033691738,-0.026755875,0.091165625,-0.054956738,-0.106839165,-0.06168921,0.029971313,-0.03799745,-0.00032759373,-0.037365254,0.018866578,-0.038664527,-0.06482417,-0.035699066,0.027678462,0.029118706,0.06125374,-0.0061239144,0.032032743,0.054286506,-0.077594236,0.0919093,-0.031143317,-0.08293913,0.011729186,-0.033874158,0.019460663,-0.10337402,-0.0034286277,-0.098347045,-0.014114635,-0.019905426,-0.07958109,0.08847445,-0.104798205,-0.06348398,0.0015179513,-0.11502928,-0.05241569,0.021057995,-0.023993207,0.037874803,0.037096087,-0.01825895,-0.08206415,-0.02828156,0.026279509,-0.049577307,-0.056944594,0.029722989,0.09024759,-0.08409505,-0.037231922,0.017837167,-0.038053267,-0.023131603,0.09008726,-0.07100982,0.020623613,0.017898975,0.0034991256,-0.0070945313,-0.042908784,-0.038924206,0.06334968,-0.022579659,-0.03733578,0.014472075,0.013820081,-0.014399576,-0.022040851,0.031843908,-0.015293412,0.023381157,0.028333476,-0.030632462,-0.026348589,0.005110818,0.020150507,-0.0050037354,0.024583388,0.052025955,0.0026486774,-0.009797876,0.07456526,0.05586892,-0.031154752,0.04247186,-0.06012159,-0.029806472,0.03393949,-0.052159