13	ngo-verification.md	NGO registration and verification: NGOs register their organization details: name, address, map location, capacity with a unit such as kg or meals, and their food requirements. After registering, an NGO waits for admin verification. Only VERIFIED NGOs can be selected for official food matching and appear in NGO search results.\n\nAn NGO user can see its incoming matches, accept or reject them, follow the assigned deliveries on the tracking page, and confirm the delivery after the volunteer has marked it as DELIVERED. An NGO can only see its own matches and assignments.	[-0.042593315,-0.01722418,-0.07277253,0.07230811,0.035808545,0.009196902,0.0095958635,-0.07551671,0.03770871,-0.04394168,0.061381124,-0.11313736,-0.008331418,0.043503694,0.033293564,-0.08150843,0.033506595,-0.009371371,-0.014946564,-0.11494087,-0.04236812,-0.0055744196,0.018899184,0.019423302,-0.049031697,-0.06093857,-0.020741254,-0.019310782,0.068212405,0.009053137,0.06046391,-0.021417713,0.06154813,0.053357687,-0.022257367,0.09089308,-0.013853622,-0.1004506,0.03296607,-0.036049917,0.01201691,-0.1504971,-0.048841022,-0.099143386,0.0005043865,0.05703747,-0.017157085,0.074167915,-0.106061816,-0.021644933,0.053607393,-0.09376914,0.0014518452,-0.008853893,-0.09631759,-0.036564205,0.064793214,-0.034036204,-0.04616404,0.015520326,0.025970371,-0.05989364,-0.049505986,0.023661101,0.047024254,0.035169873,-0.049875923,-0.0002700111,-0.016384834,-0.061943833,0.07800142,-0.0727296,0.07198427,0.081431225,-0.010861893,-0.078100674,-0.028828593,-0.014801303,0.06490878,-0.024709038,-0.01783616,0.08083768,0.030240044,0.0075393934,-0.03330067,0.072622865,-0.0562316,0.063130766,-0.0074282656,-0.091070086,0.020459788,-0.008941003,0.0031407136,-0.03438682,0.0381715,0.059106752,0.024123987,0.01819757,0.07558636,-0.019811252,-0.0082120495,-0.02793294,-0.016325267,0.019523183,0.053597875,-0.008777977,-0.009628571,0.023034763,0.06756627,0.0759419,-0.036046553,0.059725627,0.07849451,0.08879934,-0.029031