14	pickup-delivery.md	Assignments, pickup and delivery: After an NGO accepts a match, an admin creates an assignment and chooses a volunteer. The assignment starts with the status ASSIGNED. Only the assigned volunteer can update it.\n\nThe volunteer moves the assignment through the steps ASSIGNED, PICKED_UP, IN_TRANSIT and DELIVERED. While the food is on the way, the volunteer shares live location, and the donor and the NGO can follow it on the tracking page. A delivery that is DELIVERED or CANCELLED can no longer be updated.	[-0.088389665,-0.042598348,-0.028466543,0.06364446,0.009267042,0.0053423177,0.027607704,-0.12279391,-0.010401109,0.06441538,0.080240496,0.041856233,-0.042188473,0.035057,-0.020800447,-0.028752936,0.05670417,-0.041711364,-0.081593625,-0.024672337,-0.02608553,0.024945764,-0.011814287,0.027062356,0.0061391937,0.0012696834,-0.05657691,-0.050095785,0.041625556,-0.035475455,-0.00082325545,-0.059458826,0.00033946955,0.014667572,-0.03539089,0.11955287,0.00838529,-0.05486801,0.030211275,-0.03928844,0.06836571,-0.065284,-0.03535245,-0.027688619,-0.004908749,-0.016179837,-0.03224123,0.029008502,-0.05717464,-0.070686616,0.07727265,-0.11148608,-0.022325557,0.11646251,-0.06207014,0.062254526,0.086779684,-0.0150584895,-0.051469076,-0.040239125,-0.007140408,0.01678608,-0.03288251,0.03894694,0.061084934,-0.05072001,-0.033726644,-0.029879143,0.0050337105,-0.11732441,0.037412897,0.019090232,0.036064763,0.03425011,0.0527111,-0.020291695,0.05513817,0.030981043,0.0626121,-0.03361316,-0.026973568,-0.02404244,0.009942342,0.022469966,-0.05263171,0.004199275,-0.011243036,0.03008137,0.07214054,-0.024058798,-0.011155728,0.0110404575,0.046430457,-0.03644374,-0.12116828,0.0289832,0.012439953,0.076185256,-0.009534639,0.07513318,0.020723289,0.020447318,0.011356839,-0.011114538,0.010096004,-0.039186098,-0.054470625,-0.08509338,-0.0154588325,0.04608988,-0.03425603,0.043424096,0.02502491,0.03611233,-0.04414608,0.07376014,-0.051338658,0.03871305,-0.06319533,-0.07093247,-0.0067991