16	safety.md	Food safety and responsible use: Only donate food that is safe to eat. Cooked food such as rice, dal or curry should be handed over within a few hours of cooking, so set an honest expiry time. Do not donate food that smells sour, looks spoiled, has mould, has been reheated several times, or is past the date printed on its package.\n\nPack food in clean closed containers, keep hot and cold food separate, and write whether the food is vegetarian or contains egg or meat, because many NGOs can only accept vegetarian food.	[-0.022544615,0.024819432,0.0067254175,0.0358295,0.02717578,-0.004478163,-0.023209423,-0.075797684,-0.0005133241,-0.04026385,0.16046077,-0.033785455,-0.029094124,0.028148912,-0.01630902,-0.039656647,0.11964338,0.01634939,-0.09304872,-0.07555223,-0.060890347,-0.0005978285,0.025277633,-0.013316828,0.019509606,-0.048136417,0.038976714,-0.07878192,-0.009830564,-0.0036019015,0.009601072,-0.09842113,-0.037517775,0.008494459,-0.022620095,0.092761524,0.059277147,-0.07958992,0.044424072,-0.009176052,0.00158502,-0.0588103,0.01173178,-0.028304733,-0.004168578,0.0053766826,-0.024767866,-0.08064352,-0.0151059115,-0.10872232,0.056437504,-0.0019858393,0.008729272,-0.034518577,-0.004294501,-0.07120548,0.048356332,-0.029168032,-0.0863877,0.049809325,0.028235598,-0.009841003,-0.015662283,-0.06359187,0.008451768,-0.002273728,0.018862281,0.07411757,0.042606328,0.03519709,0.01910629,-0.016154014,0.07879934,-0.011845425,0.0058719097,0.030083606,0.07138852,-0.08186451,0.012648214,-0.041252796,0.013737768,0.06349558,0.056004927,0.0029749528,-0.036183354,0.0760591,-0.07870956,0.060149763,0.027361706,-0.029239992,0.010789024,0.010974253,0.10466163,-0.014258702,0.039129708,-0.015442348,-0.032830063,-0.02906195,-0.020792909,-0.02611406,-0.027373116,-0.033241056,-0.060159616,-0.0012777731,0.07258739,-0.040361483,-0.0560138,-0.061060574,-0.025398042,0.071360275,0.011573631,0.14554888,0.005479377,0.008221805,-0.017853493,0.06260634,-0.02257921,-0.09870887,-0.021007894,-